...@../../_tools/theme
direction: down

user: 사용자 { class: person }
ui: Streamlit UI { class: ours }
team: Intelligence Team { class: ours }

members: 3인 전문 에이전트 {
  class: group
  grid-columns: 3
  launch: Launch Analyst { class: ours }
  sentiment: Sentiment Specialist { class: ours }
  metrics: Metrics Specialist { class: ours }
}

session: 세션 상태 { class: store }

user -> ui: 키·회사명 입력
ui -> team: team.run(프롬프트)
team -> members: 위임(delegate_task_to_member)
ui -> session: 응답 저장
